  ('learn-bottle-rain-gauge', 'Bottle rain gauge', 'Cut the top off a plastic bottle, flip it into the base as a funnel and tape a ruler to the side. Bury it slightly in the garden and log rainfall every morning for a week.', 'learn', null, 15, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, 'how to make a rain gauge', 'published', 'seed', now()),
